{"speciesId":768,"names":{"fr":"Sarmuraï","es":"Golisopod","en":"Golisopod","ja":"グソクムシャ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il fait miroiter ses énormes griffes acérées avant d’attaquer. Elles sont assez puissantes pour fendre en deux l’air comme la mer."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Gracias a su destreza y sus enormes y afiladas garras, puede cortar hasta el aire y el agua de un solo tajo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"With a flashing slash of its giant sharp claws, it cleaves seawater—or even air—right in two."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"鋭く 巨大な ツメで 一閃。 空気や 海水さえ 一刀両断の 腕前。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il utilise ses six pattes pour se battre. Habitant des grottes sous-marines, il passe son temps plongé dans un silence méditatif."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Usa con astucia sus seis patas superiores en combate. Suele habitar las cavernas del fondo marino, donde lleva una vida contemplativa."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It battles skillfully with its six arms, but spends most of its time peacefully meditating in caves deep beneath the sea."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"６本の 腕で 巧みに 戦う。 普段は 深海の 岩穴で 瞑想するように 静かに 過ごす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La carapace qui recouvre son corps est aussi dure que le diamant. Il ne recule devant rien pour gagner."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El caparazón que protege su cuerpo es tan duro como el diamante. Hará lo que sea por conseguir la victoria."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The shell covering its body is as hard as diamond. This Pokémon will do anything it takes to win."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"身体を 覆う 硬いカラは ダイヤモンド並みの 強度を 持つ。 勝つためには 手段を 選ばない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses griffes rétractiles sont sa plus grande arme. Il se fait parfois accompagner d’une suite de Sovkipou."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su mayor arma son sus garras retráctiles. A veces va acompañado por un séquito de Wimpod."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its claws, which it can extend and retract at will, are its greatest weapons. Golisopod is sometimes accompanied by Wimpod."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"自由に 伸び縮みする ツメが 最大の 武器。 コソクムシを 従えていることも あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne recule devant rien pour gagner. Il profite de l’inattention de son adversaire pour lui administrer un coup décisif de ses petites griffes antérieures."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Hace lo que sea por conseguir la victoria. Si el rival se descuida, aprovecha para asestarle un golpe letal con sus pequeñas garras frontales."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It will do anything to win, taking advantage of every opening and finishing opponents off with the small claws on its front legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"勝つためには 手段を 問わない。 相手の 隙を ついて 前脚の 小さな ツメで とどめを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit dans des trous ou des épaves au fond de l’océan. Il se bat souvent contre Krakos, et le perdant sert de repas au gagnant."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en cavernas del fondo marino o en barcos hundidos. Lucha contra los Grapploct y el que pierde se convierte en una suculenta presa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They live in sunken ships or in holes in the seabed. When Golisopod and Grapploct battle, the loser becomes the winner’s meal."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"海底の 穴や 沈没船が すみか。 オトスパスと 戦い 負けた ほうが エサになるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":768,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"level-up",16],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",16],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[17,"level-up",41],[18,"level-up",41],[20,"level-up"